{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"houfei-e-o023b","title":"曹叡叙用舅氏赐甄像虎贲中郎将","accounts":[{"id":"houfei-e-o023b-account","label":"《后妃传》正文","text":"曹叡叙用舅氏赐甄像虎贲中郎将","evidence":["houfei-e-o023b-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wendi-p0005","role":"任用","evidence":["houfei-e-o023b-q"]},{"person":"houfei-p0034","role":"受任","evidence":["houfei-e-o023b-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":227,"label":"四月","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"houfei-y227","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"houfei-q-o022","basis":"四月"},"evidence":["houfei-e-o023b-q","houfei-q-o022","mingdi-q-o004","mingdi-q-o008","mingdi-q-b-76fba510250937628a99"]},"ordering_evidence":"houfei-e-o023b-q","source_order":[5,96,"O023b"],"order":1393}],"persons":[{"id":"houfei-p0034","name":"甄像","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wendi-p0005","name":"曹叡","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"houfei-e-o023b-q","section":"chapter-005","block":"b-726e392875bbc6d22fbc","layer":"original","quote":"四月，初营宗庙，掘地得玉玺；方一寸九分〖3〗，其文曰“天子羡思慈亲”〖4〗。明帝为之改容〖5〗，以太牢告庙，又尝梦见后；于是差次舅氏亲疏高下〖6〗，叙用各有差〖7〗；赏赐累巨万；以像为虎贲中郎将〖8〗。是月，后母薨，帝制缌服临丧〖9〗，百僚陪位。","section_title":"后妃传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0015.xhtml","index":95,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":123,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"houfei-q-o022","section":"chapter-005","block":"b-31288da490b4d6270504","layer":"original","quote":"太和元年三月，以中山魏昌之安城乡户千〖2〗，追封逸，谥曰敬侯；嫡孙像，袭爵。","section_title":"后妃传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0015.xhtml","index":94,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":38,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-q-b-76fba510250937628a99","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-76fba510250937628a99","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二年：太和二年（公元 228）。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":60,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-38a74578b09178cb1fd4","start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-q-o004","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-3d867ec3331f738aeaf5","layer":"original","quote":"太和元年春正月，郊祀武皇帝，以配天；宗祀文皇帝于明堂，以配上帝〖1〗。分江夏南部，置江夏南部都尉。西平麹英反，杀临羌令、西都长〖2〗。遣将军郝昭、鹿磐，讨斩之。二月，辛未〖3〗，帝耕于籍田。辛巳〖4〗，立文昭皇后寝庙于邺。丁亥〖5〗，朝日于东郊。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":30,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":123,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-q-o008","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-bec9198de0001b0aa26c","layer":"original","quote":"二年春正月〖1〗，宣王攻破新城。斩达，传其首〖2〗。﹝一﹞分新城之上庸、武陵、巫县为上庸郡〖3〗，锡县为锡郡。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":54,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":55,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
